147.7, 140.1, 139.8, 129.1, 128.0, 127.6, 124.6, 124.5, 123.9, 120.8,
117.5. 11B NMR (128.38 MHz, acetone-d 6) δ 37.0. IR (neat) 3371, 3056,
2945, 1612, 1560, 1426, 1336, 877, 757, 693 cm-1. HRMS (CI) m/z calcd for
C13H12BNS [M]+ 225.0784, found 225.0784.
