$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 5. Synthesis of pyrazoles 7a-h (Scheme 4)
3-[3-(4-Fluorophenyl)-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-1H-pyrazol-5-yl]pyridine (7h):
84% yield, colourless oil,. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 3.86 (s, 3H),
6.87 (s, 1H), 6.93 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 7.13-7.18 (m, 2H), 7.28-7.31 (m,
3H), 7.58 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H), 7.91 (dd, J = 5.5 and 2.0 Hz, 1H), 8.63
(d, J = 4.0 Hz, 1H), 8.67 (s, H).13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 55.6,
105.0, 114.5, 115.7 (d, J = 22.0 Hz), 123.6, 127.0, 127.6 (d, J = 8.1
Hz), 129.1 (d, J = 2.9 Hz), 132.7, 136.2, 141.0, 148.7, 151.2, 159.4,
162.9 (d, J = 246.5 Hz). HRMS (Cl): MH+, 346.1355 ; calcd. for C21H17FN3O
: 346.1356.
