$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 5-(6-Bromo-4-methoxy-1-(triisopropylsilyl)-indol-3-yl)-2-(triisopropylsilyl)oxazole
(12) 6-Bromo-3-iodo-4-methoxy-1-(triisopropylsilyl)-indole (6) (1.00 g,
1.97 mmol) and (2-(triisopropylsilyl)oxazol-5-yl)boronic acid pinacol
ester (11) (724 mg, 2.06 mmol) were dissolved in toluene (3 mL) and
potassium phosphate (1.25 g, 5.90 mmol) in water (1.5 mL) was added. The
solution was degassed by three freeze-pump-thaw cycles and
Pd(dppf)Cl2·CH2Cl2 (81 mg, 0.10 mmol, 5 mol %) was added and the
resulting mixture was stirred at 50°C for 2 h. The mixture was
partitioned between water and EtOAc and the aqueous phase was extracted
with EtOAc (2×50 mL). The combined organic phases were washed with brine,
dried over MgSO4, filtered and evaporated. The residue was purified by
flash chromatography eluting with 5→15% EtOAc in cyclohexane. The title
compound (996 mg, 83%) as yellow oil. R f = 0.37 (Cyclohexane/EtOAc 9:1)
1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz): δ 7.53 (s, 1H), 7.48 (s, 1H), 7.24 (d, J = 1.4,
1H), 6.71 (d, J = 1.2, 1H), 3.93 (s, 3H), 1.66 (sept., J = 7.5, 3H), 1.44
(sept., J = 7.5, 3H), 1.20 (d, J = 7.5, 18H), 1.16 (d, J = 7.5, 18H). 13C
NMR (CDCl3, 101 MHz): δ 166.1, 145.1, 143.5, 140.8, 129.4, 123.5, 116.6,
116.3, 110.5, 108.2, 105.3, 55.4, 18.6, 18.2, 12.9, 11.2. HRMS (ESI): m/z
[M+H]+ Calcd for C30H50BrN2O2Si2: 605.2589; found: 605.2597.
