$DATUM 5-(Furan-2-yl)-4-methyl-7-(β-
D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]-pyrimidine (6a). An argon-purged
mixture of 19 (258 mg, 0.75 mmol), furan-2-boronic acid (126 mg, 1.125
mmol), Na2CO3 (239 mg, 2.25 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (8 mg, 35.6 μmol), and TPPTS
(53 mg, 93 μmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 1 h.
After cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aq HCl (1 M),
concentrated to dryness in vacuo and the residue was purified by reverse
phase HPFC (C-18, 0→ 100% MeOH in water) to furnish 6a Orange foam, yield
207 mg, 83%. [α ]D -75.3 (c 0.219, DMSO). 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 2.65
(s, 3H, CH3); 3.57 (bdt, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5′ a,OH = J5′ a, 4′ = 4.5
Hz, H-5′a); 3.66 (bdt, 1H, Jgem = 11.9 Hz, J5′b,OH = J5′′ = 4.4 Hz,
H-5′b); 3.94 (bq, 1H, J4′ ,5′ a = J4′ ,5′ b = J4′ ,3′ = 3.6 Hz, H-4′);
4.13 (m, 1H, H-3′); 4.45 (btd, 1H, J2′ ,1′ = J2′,OH = 6.2 Hz, J2′′ = 5.3
Hz, H-2′); 5.10 (bt, 1H, JOH,5′a = JOH,5′b = 5.4 Hz, OH-5′); 5.20 (d, 1H,
JOH,3′ = 4.8 Hz, OH-3′); 5.41 (d, 1H, JOH,2′ = 6.4 Hz, OH-2′); 6.26 (d,
1H, J1′′ = 6.1 Hz, H-1′); 6.62 (dd, 1H, J4,3 = 3.3 Hz, J4,5 = 1.9 Hz,
H-4-furyl); 6.66 (dd, 1H, J3,4 = 3.3 Hz, J3,5 = 0.9 Hz, H-3-furyl); 7.80
(dd, 1H, J5,4 = 1.9 Hz, J5,3 = 0.9 Hz, H-5-furyl); 8.07 (s, 1H, H-6);
8.71 (s, 1H, H-2). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d6): 23.03 (CH3); 61.63
(CH2-5′); 70.71 (CH-3′); 74.31 (CH-2′); 85.50 (CH-4′); 86.79 (CH-1′);
106.79 (C-5); 108.50 (CH-3-furyl); 111.75 (CH-4-furyl); 115.36 (C-4a);
125.82 (CH-6); 142.93 (CH-5-furyl); 147.62 (C-2-furyl); 150.82 (C-7a);
151.38 (CH-2); 159.71 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν 1571, 1438, 1348, 1201, 1120,
1080, 1031, 968, 892, 792, 736, 637 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 332 (M + H), 354
(M + Na). HRMS (ESI) for C16H18N3O5 [M + H] calcd: 332.12410; found:
332.12406. Anal. (C16H17N3O5•3/4H2O): C, H, N.
