$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (R)-8-((2-(5-Fluoro-1H-indol-4-yl)-4-morpholinothieno[3,2-d]pyrimidin-6-yl)methyl)octahydropyrazino[2,1-c][1,4]oxazine
(6). A mixture of (R)-8-(2-chloro-4-morpholin-4-ylthieno[3,2-d]-
pyrimidin-6-ylmethyl)octahydropyrazino[2,1-c][1,4]oxazine (34) (200 mg,
0.49 mmol), Cs2CO3 (318 mg, 0.98 mmol), 1-(tertbutyldimethylsilanyl)-
5-fluoro-4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-[1,3,2]- dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-indole
(238 mg, 0.63 mmol), and tetrakis- (triphenylphosphine)palladium (56 mg,
0.05 mmol) in dioxane/water (8 mL/4 mL) was heated at 140 °C for 25 min
in a microwave reactor. The resulting cooled mixture was loaded onto an
SCX column, and the column was washed with DCM and methanol. The product
was eluted with 2 M NH3 in methanol, and the product fractions were
concentrated in vacuo. The residue obtained was purified by column
chromatography on silica using 1-10% 2 M NH3 in EtOAc as eluant to give
compound 6. Yellow solid, yield 207 mg, 83%. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
1.91 (m, 1 H), 2.36-2.47 (m, 4 H), 2.63-2.78 (m, 3 H), 2.95 (d, J= 8.6
Hz, 1 H), 3.25 (m, 1 H), 3.62-3.74 (m, 2 H), 3.81-3.89 (m, 7 H), 4.05 (t,
J= 4.7 Hz, 4 H), 6.88-6.90 (m, 1 H), 7.05 (dd, J= 10.9, 8.8 Hz, 1 H),
7.28 (m, 1 H), 7.34-7.39 (m, 2 H) and 8.22 (br s, 1H). RT: 6.61 min. LCMS
m/z [M + H]+ 509.2. Analytical LC-MS on an Agilent (1200/G6140) using a
1.8uM, 2.1 mm × 30 mm ZORBAX SD-C18 analytical column, 40 °C, 400 μL/
min, and H2O/MeCN modified with 0.05% trifluoroacetic acid running a
linear gradient from 3% MeCN to 95% MeCN in 10 min monitoring by UV
wavelength 254 nm and ESI+ TIC MS showed 97% purity.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, thermal, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
