61.89 (CH2-5´); 70.80 (CH-3'); 73.51 (CH-2'); 84.92 (CH-4´); 86.25
(CH-1´); 94.52 (C-4a); 109.11 (C-5); 118.20 (CH-6); 125.19
(CH-5-thienyl); 125.55 (CH-3-thienyl); 128.26 (CH-4-thienyl); 136.89
(C-2-thienyl); 153.93 (C-7a); 157.88 (C-4); 160.10 (C-2). IR (ATR): ν
1602, 1566, 1446, 1423, 1298, 1082, 1029, 975, 841, 792, 699 cm-1. MS
(ESI) m/z 364 (M+H), 386 (M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C15H18N5O4S [M+H] calcd:
364.10740; found: 364.10750. Anal. (C15H17N5O4S• 0.85H2O): C, H, N.
