3-[3-Bromo-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-1H-pyrazol-5-yl]pyridine (6c): 83% yield,
white solid,. Mp:70-72°C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 3.80 (s, 3H), 6.57
(s, 1H), 6.85 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 7.17 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 2H), 7.18-7.26
(m, 1H), 7.43 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H), 8.52 (s, 1H), 8.55 (d, J = 4.5 Hz,
1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 55.6, 110.2, 114.5, 123.4, 125.7,
127.0, 127.4, 132.0, 135.9, 141.9, 149.4, 149.9, 159.6. HRMS (El): M+,
329.0164; calcd. for C15H12BrN3O : 329.0164.
