$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2-(4,4,5,5-Tetramethyl[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-2-yl)-5,10,15,20-tetrakis(4-tolyl)porphyrin
(17). Porphyrin 16b (350 mg, 0.38 mmol), (Bpin)2 (260 mg, 0.95 mmol) and
KOAc (370 mg, 3.79 mmol) were dissolved in toluene (100 mL) and water (20
mL) and degassed with an argon stream in an ultrasonic bath for 15 min.
Pd(dppf)Cl2 (31 mg, 0.038 mmol) was added and the mixture was degassed
for a further 20 min. Then the reaction mixture was heated to 110 °C for
6 h. After it was cooled to room temperature, the organic phase was
filtered over a plug of silica and fully eluted with ethyl acetate. After
evaporation of all solvents, the residue was purified by column
chromatography (silica, n-hexane/dichloromethane 2/1 → 0/ 1). The product
was recrystallized from chloroform/methanol. A purple solid. 304 mg, 83%
yield. Mp >300 °C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ -2.57 (s, 2H), 1.59 (s,
9H), 1.62 (s, 9H), 1.62 (s, 9H), 1.64 (s, 9H), 7.75-7.83 (m, 8H),
8.12-8.27 (m, 8H), 8.64 (d, 3 J = 4.9 Hz, 1H), 8.77 (d, 3 J = 4.8 Hz,
1H), 8.85 (d, 3 J = 5.3 Hz, 4H), 9.14 (s, 1H) ppm. 13C NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 150.6, 150.5, 150.3, 140.7, 139.6, 139.5, 139.2, 136.6, 135.0,
134.8, 134.7, 123.9, 123.8, 123.7, 123.7, 121.8, 120.4, 120.1, 119.9,
83.8, 35.1, 35.0, 35.0, 31.9, 31.9, 25.4 ppm. MS (MALDI): m/z 964.566
[M]+. HRMS (ESI): calcd for C66H74BN4O2 [M + H]+ 965.58993, found
965.59112.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM ultrasound, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Monomeric Chiral and Achiral Basket-Handle Porphyrins: Synthesis,
Structural Features, and Arrested Tautomerism
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Gehrold, Andreas C.; Bruhn, Torsten; Schneider, Heidi; Radius, Udo;
Bringmann, Gerhard
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2015), 80(24), 12359-12378

