$DATUM Versatile imidazo[1,2-a]pyridine carboxylic acid 4 could be prepared in
four steps from commercially available 2-amino pyridine 2 (Scheme 1).
Alkylation/cyclization with α-bromopyruvate, followed by selective
chlorination with NCS and tandem Suzuki cross-coupling/hydrolysis,
affords furan 4. Yield 82%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Imidazo[1,2-a]pyridines That Directly Interact with Hepatitis C NS4B:
Initial Preclinical Characterization
