$DATUM 5-Pyridin-3-y1H-indole (25a). The title compound was synthesized
according to method A using crude 5-bromoindole (250 mg, 1.26 mmol),
pyridin-3-ylboronic acid (186 mg, 1.51 mmol), sodium carbonate (667 mg,
6.30 mmol), and tetrakis- (triphenylphosphine)palladium(0) (73 mg, 0.06
mmol) in dimethoxyethane (30 mL) and water (10 mL). The crude product was
purified by flash column chromatography on silica gel (EtOAc/n-hexane,
1:100 to 1:2). Pale yellow solid, yield 202 mg, 82%. 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 7.37 (ddd, J = 0.8, 4.8, 7.9 Hz, 1H), 7.41 (m, 1H), 7.49 (m,
2H), 7.59 (m, 2H), 7.88 (dt, J = 2.0, 7.9 Hz, 1H), 8.60 (dd, J = 1.6, 4.8
Hz, 1H), 8.86 (dd, J = 0.6, 2.4 Hz, 1H).
